OL,3,AIndia 'cockroach' party says its
OL,4,Aleaders detained ahead of march
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of people, including Cockroach
OL,7,FJanta Party leader Abhijeet Dipke, have
OL,8,Fbeen detained in India's capital Delhi
OL,9,Fahead of a major protest, the
OL,10,Fcollective says
OL,12,FParts of the city have been turned into
OL,13,Fa fortress, with tens of thousands of
OL,14,Fsecurity personnel deployed and roads
OL,15,Fleading to the protest site blocked
OL,17,FThe protesters want electoral reforms
OL,18,Fand the resignation of India's election
OL,19,Fchief, Gyanesh Kumar, over allegations
OL,20,Fof manipulation of voters' lists
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
