OL,3,AIndia 'cockroach' party says its
OL,4,Aleaders detained ahead of march
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Election Commission denies the
OL,7,Fallegations, while Kumar is yet to
OL,8,Fcomment on calls for his resignation
OL,10,FPolice had refused permission for the
OL,11,Fprotest, saying they fear a repeat of
OL,12,Fviolence seen at earlier demonstrations
OL,14,FThe CJP began as a satirical online
OL,15,Fcampaign before growing into a
OL,16,Fyouth-led movement that has drawn
OL,17,Fthousands onto the streets
OL,19,FIts last major protest in July saw
OL,20,Fviolent clashes with police and forced
OL,21,FIndia's education minister to resign
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
